    "TitleKey": "Battaglia_RPT_ScanMine_03_title",
    "Description": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Scan And Mining Needed\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nI have a job here that might interest you. I need people to go out and do some basic mining in order to pull some geological data for future prospecting. Need someone to scope out and mine <EM4>~mission(Resources)</EM4> <EM4>~mission(MineableType)</EM4>. You'll be helping us out massively. ~mission(Rarity)\n\nAlso, if you're stuck or new to mining, there's a <EM4>journal on mining by the United Resource Workers in your mobi</EM4> that you should check out.\n\nKeep me posted.\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon full area scan confirmation and extraction.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
    "DescriptionKey": "Battaglia_RPT_ScanMine_03_desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Scan And Mining Needed\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nI have a job here that might interest you. I need people to go out and do some basic mining in order to pull some geological data for future prospecting. Need someone to scope out and mine <EM4>[AmountToScan] of Torite, [AmountToScan2] of Ice and [AmountToScan3] of Aluminium</EM4> <EM4>Asteroid</EM4>. You'll be helping us out massively. These might be a little tricky to find, just a head's up.\n\nAlso, if you're stuck or new to mining, there's a <EM4>journal on mining by the United Resource Workers in your mobi</EM4> that you should check out.\n\nKeep me posted.\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon full area scan confirmation and extraction.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
